# Future Improvements

## Version 2

### AI Assisted Transliteration

Instead of rules only,

Use an LLM to predict uncommon names.

Example

```
Xavier

↓

زافيير
```

---

### Phonetic Encoding

Build custom Arabic Soundex.

Example

```
محمد
Mohamed
Mohammad
Muhammad
```

↓

```
MHMD
```

All become one phonetic key.

---

### Caching

Cache frequently translated names.

Redis

```
Mohamed

↓

محمد
```

No need to transliterate repeatedly.

---

### Database Dictionary

Instead of JSON

```
Dictionary
```

Store

```
Name
Language
Popularity
Country
Gender
Frequency
```

This allows regional spellings.

Example

```
Mohamed
```

Egypt

↓

```
محمد
```

Turkey

↓

```
Mehmet
```

---

### Machine Learning Ranking

Use search history.

If users always choose

```
Mohamed Ahmed Hassan
```

Rank it first next time.

